ransition-[border-color,box-shadow] outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-[var(--kro-opacity-disabled)] aria-invalid:border-kro-banner-danger file:inline-flex file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-xs file:font-medium min-h-11" id="_r_q_-email" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required="" aria-required="true" aria-describedby="_r_q_-notice" type="email" value="ada@example.com" name="email"><p id="_r_q_-notice" class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary text-xs">We keep your address and platform pick only to tell you when early access opens, then delete them. The sign-up also records which part of the page you used, your browser's language and the time. To be removed sooner, write to us through the link in the footer.</p></div></div><fieldset class="m-0 grid min-w-0 gap-kro-small border-0 p-0"><legend class="px-0 pb-kro-small font-medium text-kro-fore text-sm">Which platform should we write about?</legend><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-kro-small sm:grid-cols-4"><label class="relative flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer"><input class="peer absolute inset-0 m-0 size-full cursor-pointer opacity-0" type="radio" value="ios" name="early-access-platform"><span class="flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-kro-pill border border-kro-hairline px-kro-small text-kro-fore text-sm peer-checked:border-transparent peer-checked:bg-kro-accent peer-checked:font-semibold peer-checked:text-kro-on-accent peer-focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]">iPhone</span></label><label class="relative flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer"><input class="peer absolute inset-0 m-0 size-full cursor-pointer opacity-0" type="radio" value="ipados" name="early-access-platform"><span class="flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-kro-pill border border-kro-hairline px-kro-small text-kro-fore text-sm peer-checked:border-transparent peer-checked:bg-kro-accent peer-checked:font-semibold peer-checked:text-kro-on-accent peer-focus-visible:shadow-[var(--k