hadow-[var(--kro-ring)]">Android</span></label><label class="relative flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer"><input class="peer absolute inset-0 m-0 size-full cursor-pointer opacity-0" type="radio" value="windows" name="early-access-platform"><span class="flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-kro-pill border border-kro-hairline px-kro-small text-kro-fore text-sm peer-checked:border-transparent peer-checked:bg-kro-accent peer-checked:font-semibold peer-checked:text-kro-on-accent peer-focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]">Windows</span></label></div></fieldset><div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: -10000px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden;"><label for="_r_q_-website">Website</label><input id="_r_q_-website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" type="text" value="" name="website"></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-kro-medium"><button data-slot="button" data-shape="circular" data-size="lg" type="submit" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1 cursor-default whitespace-nowrap font-medium kro-motion-quick transition-[color,background-color,box-shadow,transform] outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-[var(--kro-opacity-disabled)] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none kro-glass kro-glass--control kro-glass--accent kro-glass--interactive text-kro-on-accent h-11 rounded-kro-small px-kro-medium text-sm rounded-kro-pill [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4">Get early access</button><p class="m-0 max-w-[40ch] text-sm" style="color: var(--kro-color-fore-secondary-on-glass);">We don't show sign-up counts, ratings or quotes here. We'll email you when your platform is ready.</p></div></form></div></div></div></div></section></div></div>"`;

exports[`landing story snapshots > FaqSection > Closed 1`] = `"<div><div data-theme="light" data-kro-idiom="desktop" data-slot="marketing-story-stage" style="width: 100%; max-width: 100%; background: var(--kro-color-back); color: var(--kro-color-fore); font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;"><section id="faq" data-tone="subtle" aria-labelledby="faq-title" class="kro-marketing-section"><div class="kro-marketing-container kro-marketing-container--narrow"><header data-align="start" data-level="2" class="kro-section-header"><p class="kro-eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 id="faq-title" class="kro-display-2">Good questions, plainly answered.</h2></header><div data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal"><div data-slot="accordion" data-size="large" data-density="comfortable" class="flex w-full flex-col [&amp;_button]:min-h-11"><div data-slot="accordion-item"><button type="button" id="_r_t_-endeavor-header" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_t_-endeavor-panel" class="flex w-full items-center gap-kro-small px-kro-medium min-h-9 text-sm text-left text-kro-fore outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right kro-motion-quick shrink-0 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium">What is an endeavor?</span></button><div id="_r_t_-endeavor-panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="_r_t_-endeavor-header" hidden="" data-slot="accordion-panel" class="px-kro-medium pb-kro-small text-kro-fore"><p class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary">An endeavor is anything you have decided is worth your time — a task, an event or a habit. Capture creates it, and it travels through the loop until it is done.</p></div></div><div data-slot="accordion-item"><div aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-divider" class="h-px bg-kro-hairline"></div><button type="button" id="_r_t_-free-header" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_t_-free-panel" class="flex w-full items-center gap-kro-small px-kro-medium min-h-9 text-sm text-left text-kro-fore outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right kro-motion-quick shrink-0 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium">Is Kro free?</span></button><div id="_r_t_-free-panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="_r_t_-free-header" hidden="" data-slot="accordion-panel" class="px-kro-medium pb-kro-small text-kro-fore"><p class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary">Kro for Web is open to use today, and you can start without an account. We have not announced pricing for the other platforms, and we would rather say so than guess.</p></div></div><div data-slot="accordion-item"><div aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-divider" class="h-px bg-kro-hairline"></div><button type="button" id="_r_t_-data-header" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_t_-data-panel" class="flex w-full items-center gap-kro-small px-kro-medium min-h-9 text-sm text-left text-kro-fore outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right kro-motion-quick shrink-0 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium">Where is my data stored?</span></button><div id="_r_t_-data-panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="_r_t_-data-header" hidden="" data-slot="accordion-panel" class="px-kro-medium pb-kro-small text-kro-fore"><p class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary">On your device first. If you sign in, your plans sync through Kro Cloud. Analytics counts, timings, the page you are on and your browser's size and language — never the words you write.</p></div></div><div data-slot="accordion-item"><div aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-divider" class="h-px bg-kro-hairline"></div><button type="button" id="_r_t_-offline-header" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_t_-offline-panel" class="flex w-full items-center gap-kro-small px-kro-medium min-h-9 text-sm text-left text-kro-fore outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right kro-motion-quick shrink-0 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium">Does it work offline?</span></button><div id="_r_t_-offline-panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="_r_t_-offline-header" hidden="" data-slot="accordion-panel" class="px-kro-medium pb-kro-small text-kro-fore"><p class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary">Kro for Web installs as an app and its shell opens without a connection, with your plans kept on your device. Syncing through Kro Cloud needs a connection.</p></div></div><div data-slot="accordion-item"><div aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-divider" class="h-px bg-kro-hairline"></div><button type="button" id="_r_t_-platforms-header" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_t_-platforms-panel" class="flex w-full items-center gap-kro-small px-kro-medium min-h-9 text-sm text-left text-kro-fore outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right kro-motion-quick shrink-0 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium">Which platforms?</span></button><div id="_r_t_-platforms-panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="_r_t_-platforms-header" hidden="" data-slot="accordion-panel" class="px-kro-medium pb-kro-small text-kro-fore"><p class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary">The web is live. iPhone, iPad, Mac and Apple Watch are in early access on TestFlight, Android is in progress and Windows is coming. Vote for the one you want sooner.</p></div></div><div data-slot="accordion-item"><div aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-divider" class="h-px bg-kro-hairline"></div><button type="button" id="_r_t_-todo-header" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_t_-todo-panel" class="flex w-full items-center gap-kro-small px-kro-medium min-h-9 text-sm text-left text-kro-fore outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right kro-motion-quick shrink-0 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium">How is this different from a to-do list?</span></button><div id="_r_t_-todo-panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="_r_t_-todo-header" hidden="" data-slot="accordion-panel" class="px-kro-medium pb-kro-small text-kro-fore"><p class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary">A to-do list stores tasks. Kro runs the whole loop: Capture, Triage with Value and Effort, Plan, Do with focus Sessions, and Earn what you have worked for.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section></div></div>"`;

