0 0-2 1.61l-.78 4.05"></path><path d="m7.88 16.36.8 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h2.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61l.81-4.05"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle></svg></span><div><h3 class="m-0 font-semibold text-kro-fore text-lg">On your wrist</h3><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-kro-fore-secondary">The wrist is a mirror, not a second opinion.</p></div></li></ul><div data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal grid grid-cols-1 justify-items-center gap-kro-x-large"><div class="flex items-end justify-center gap-kro-large"><div class="w-[min(60vw,260px)]"><div class="kro-device kro-device--phone" style="--kro-device-w: 800px;"><img width="780" height="1342" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Kro's focus session sheet on a phone-sized window: a Pomodoro clock counting down from fifteen minutes for the task Prepare slides, with pause and stop buttons." src="/landing/web/web-session-mobile-dark.webp"></div></div><div class="w-[min(26vw,120px)]"><div class="kro-device kro-device--watch" style="--kro-device-w: 412px;"><img width="396" height="484" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Kro on Apple Watch: a Now Hero card for the high-priority task Prepare presentation at 7:00 PM with a Start Focus 45m button." src="/landing/watchos/watch-featured.webp"></div></div></div><figure class="m-0 w-full max-w-[420px]"><img width="844" height="384" alt="Kro's lock screen Live Activity on iPhone: a purple card reading Focusing, Draft release notes and 15:00, with Pause and Finish buttons." loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="block h-auto w-full rounded-kro-surface border border-kro-hairline shadow-kro-card" src="/landing/ios/ios-live-activity-running.webp"></figure></div></div></div></section></div></div>"`;

