e-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-moon kro-theme-toggle__icon kro-theme-toggle__icon--moon" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20.985 12.486a9 9 0 1 1-9.473-9.472c.405-.022.617.46.402.803a6 6 0 0 0 8.268 8.268c.344-.215.825-.004.803.401"></path></svg></button></div><a href="https://app.kro.example/my-day" data-slot="button" data-shape="rounded" data-size="pill" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1 cursor-default whitespace-nowrap font-medium kro-motion-quick transition-[color,background-color,box-shadow,transform] outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-[var(--kro-opacity-disabled)] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none kro-glass kro-glass--control kro-glass--accent kro-glass--interactive text-kro-on-accent h-9 rounded-kro-pill px-kro-medium text-sm [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4 kro-marketing-nav__cta">Open Kro</a><button type="button" class="kro-marketing-nav__menu" aria-label="Open menu" aria-haspopup="dialog" aria-expanded="false" data-state="closed"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-menu" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 5h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 19h16"></path></svg></button></div></header></div><main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="overflow-x-clip outline-none"><section id="top" data-tone="gradient" aria-labelledby="top-title" class="kro-marketing-section"><div aria-hidden="true" data-testid="detail-backdrop" class="kro-detail-backdrop"></div><div class="kro-marketing-container kro-marketing-container--wide"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><span class="kro-hairline-grid absolute inset-0 opacity-30"></span><span class="kro-glow-blob" style="top: -30%; left: -12%;"></span><span class="kro-glow-blob kro-glow-blob--grape" style="bottom: -34%; right: -10%;"></span></div><div class="relative grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-kro-xx-large lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,5fr)_minmax(0,6fr)]"><div class="kro-hero-copy grid grid-cols-1 justify-items-start gap-kro-large"><p class="kro-eyebrow">Plan · Do · Earn</p><h1 id="top-title" class="kro-display-hero">Control your time. Don't let time control you.</h1><p class="kro-lede">Plan, Do and Earn, in one personal execution system — on your Mac, iPhone, Apple Watch and the web.</p><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-kro-small"><a href="https://app.kro.example/my-day" data-slot="button" data-shape="circular" data-size="lg" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1 cursor-default whitespace-nowrap font-medium kro-motion-quick transition-[color,background-color,box-shadow,transform] outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-[var(--kro-opacity-disabled)] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none kro-glass kro-glass--control kro-glass--accent kro-glass--interactive text-kro-on-accent h-11 rounded-kro-small px-kro-medium text-sm rounded-kro-pill [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4">Open Kro for Web</a><a href="#early-access" data-slot="button" data-shape="circular" data-size="lg" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1 cursor-default whitespace-nowrap font-medium kro-motion-quick transition-[color,background-color,box-shadow,transform] outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-[var(--kro-opacity-disabled)] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none kro-glass kro-glass--control kro-glass--interactive text-kro-fore h-11 rounded-kro-small px-kro-medium text-sm rounded-kro-pill [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4">Get early access</a></div></div><div class="relative flex flex-col md:block md:pb-12"><div class="order-first mx-auto mb-kro-large w-[min(100%,240px)] md:absolute md:right-[2%] md:bottom-0 md:order-none md:mx-0 md:mb-0 md:w-[30%] md:min-w-[180px]"><div class="kro-device kro-device--phone" style="--kro-device-w: 800px;"><img width="780" height="1688" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" alt="Kro on iPhone, Plan in timeline view: a week strip with Monday the 20th selected above an hourly day grid holding Quick Sync, Team Standup and Product Design events." src="/landing/ios/ios-plan-timeline.webp"></div></div><div class="md:w-[88%]"><div class="kro-device kro-device--mac" style="--kro-device-w: 1424px;"><div class="kro-glass kro-glass--bar kro-device__titlebar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="kro-device__lights" aria-hidden="true"><span class="kro-device__light"></span><span class="kro-device__light"></span><span class="kro-device__light"></span></span><span class="kro-device__title">Kro</span></div><img width="1424" height="1280" decoding="async" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" alt="Kro's My Day in a desktop-sized window, dark theme: the header with the date and progress ring, reminders, a calendar event and the Now lane of task cards on a dark canvas." src="/landing/web/web-my-day-desktop-dark.webp"></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id="the-loop" data-tone="canvas" aria-labelledby="the-loop-title" class="kro-marketing-section"><div class="kro-marketing-container kro-marketing-container--wide"><header data-align="start" data-level="2" class="kro-section-header"><p class="kro-eyebrow">The loop</p><h2 id="the-loop-title" class="kro-display-2">A day, resolved.</h2><p class="kro-lede">Capture a thought, triage it, plan it, do it and earn from it. Five small steps, one calm loop.</p></header><article data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-kro-xx-large py-kro-x-large md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-24"><div><header data-align="start" data-level="3" class="kro-section-header mb-kro-large!"><p class="kro-eyebrow">1 · Capture</p><h3 id="chapter-capture-title" class="kro-display-2">Get it out of your head.</h3><p class="kro-lede">Capture is the one place where a thought becomes an endeavor. Type it, and it waits in your Inbox until you are ready to decide.</p></header><ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap gap-kro-small p-0"><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">One prompt, always within reach</li><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Everything lands in the Inbox</li></ul></div><div><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[300px]"><div class="kro-device kro-device--phone" style="--kro-device-w: 800px;"><img width="780" height="1688" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Kro on iPhone, Inbox with three endeavors: Recently Added items and a Pending Triage item, each with Triage and Add for Today buttons." src="/landing/ios/ios-inbox.webp"></div></div></div></article><article data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-kro-xx-large py-kro-x-large md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-24"><div class="md:order-2"><header data-align="start" data-level="3" class="kro-section-header mb-kro-large!"><p class="kro-eyebrow">2 · Triage</p><h3 id="chapter-triage-title" class="kro-display-2">Decide, one card at a time.</h3><p class="kro-lede">Triage turns the Inbox into decisions. Rate each endeavor with Value stars and Effort flames, then choose what it deserves.</p></header><ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap gap-kro-small p-0"><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Prioritize</li><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Schedule</li><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Delegate</li><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Archive</li></ul></div><div class="md:order-1"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[300px]"><div class="kro-device kro-device--phone" style="--kro-device-w: 800px;"><img width="780" height="1688" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Kro on iPhone, triage form for the task Email VP about timeline: value stars, due date, duration chips and an urgent-and-important matrix with Prioritize chosen, plus Ready and Start Now buttons." src="/landing/ios/ios-triage-prioritize.webp"></div></div></div></article><article data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-kro-xx-large py-kro-x-large md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-24"><div><header data-align="start" data-level="3" class="kro-section-header mb-kro-large!"><p class="kro-eyebrow">3 · Plan</p><h3 id="chapter-plan-title" class="kro-display-2">See the day you are choosing.</h3><p class="kro-lede">Plan lays the same endeavors out three honest ways, so you can pick the view that fits the question you are asking.</p></header><ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap gap-kro-small p-0"><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Timeline</li><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">List</li><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Priority Matrix</li></ul></div><div><div class="flex items-end justify-center gap-kro-large"><div class="w-[52%] max-w-[300px]"><div class="kro-device kro-device--mac" style="--kro-device-w: 760px;"><div class="kro-glass kro-glass--bar kro-device__titlebar" aria-hidden="true"><span class="kro-device__lights" aria-hidden="true"><span class="kro-device__light"></span><span class="kro-device__light"></span><span class="kro-device__light"></span></span><span class="kro-device__title">Plan</span></div><img width="760" height="1536" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Kro's Plan timeline for a busy Monday: a day picker above an hourly grid with overlapping events such as Design review, Vendor call, Sync and Retro." src="/landing/web/web-plan-timeline-desktop-light.webp"></div></div><div class="w-[40%] max-w-[240px]"><div class="kro-device kro-device--phone" style="--kro-device-w: 800px;"><img width="780" height="1688" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Kro on iPhone, Plan in priority matrix view: four cards named Prioritize, Schedule, Delegate and Archive, each holding task tiles, with Add new and Add existing buttons on Archive." src="/landing/ios/ios-plan-matrix.webp"></div></div></div></div></article><article data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-kro-xx-large py-kro-x-large md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-24"><div class="md:order-2"><header data-align="start" data-level="3" class="kro-section-header mb-kro-large!"><p class="kro-eyebrow">4 · Do</p><h3 id="chapter-do-title" class="kro-display-2">Know what is next.</h3><p class="kro-lede">My Day sorts what is on your plate into lanes, so the next move is never a guess.</p></header><ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap gap-kro-small p-0"><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Now</li><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Overdue</li><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Next</li><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Later</li><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Anytime</li></ul></div><div class="md:order-1"><div class="mx-auto w-full max-w-[300px]"><div class="kro-device kro-device--phone" style="--kro-device-w: 800px;"><img width="780" height="1280" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Kro's My Day in a phone-sized window, dark theme: the date and progress ring, reminders, a calendar event and the Now lane of task cards." src="/landing/web/web-my-day-mobile-dark.webp"></div></div></div></article><article data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-kro-xx-large py-kro-x-large md:grid-cols-2 md:gap-24"><div><header data-align="start" data-level="3" class="kro-section-header mb-kro-large!"><p class="kro-eyebrow">5 · Earn</p><h3 id="chapter-earn-title" class="kro-display-2">Finished work should feel like something.</h3><p class="kro-lede">Rewards, Milestones and Challenges turn finished work into prizes you chose. A closed ring means you’ve finished everything the day asked of you.</p></header><ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap gap-kro-small p-0"><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Rewards</li><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Milestones</li><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Challenges</li><li class="rounded-full border border-kro-hairline px-kro-medium py-1 text-kro-fore-secondary text-sm">Day Progress rings</li></ul></div><div><div class="flex items-start justify-center gap-kro-large"><div class="w-[46%] max-w-[240px]"><div class="kro-device kro-device--phone" style="--kro-device-w: 481px;"><img width="461" height="1000" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Kro on Android, the Earn screen on a dark theme with a Milestone reached celebration popup over the in-progress rewards, after a reward was claimed." src="/landing/android/android-earn-celebrating.webp"></div></div><div class="mt-kro-xx-large w-[46%] max-w-[240px]"><div class="kro-device kro-device--phone" style="--kro-device-w: 800px;"><img width="780" height="1688" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Kro on iPhone, Day Progress on a dark screen: a week of activity rings, a large ring with Habits 0 of 1 and Tasks 1 of 3 done, and an activity list with Deep work on Kro, Read a chapter and Meditate." src="/landing/ios/ios-day-progress.webp"></div></div></div></div></article></div></section><section id="focus" data-tone="subtle" aria-labelledby="focus-title" class="kro-marketing-section"><div class="kro-marketing-container kro-marketing-container--wide"><header data-align="start" data-level="2" class="kro-section-header"><p class="kro-eyebrow">Focus</p><h2 id="focus-title" class="kro-display-2">Stay with one thing.</h2><p class="kro-lede">Start a Session from any endeavor: a countdown or a stopwatch, with breaks built in.</p></header><div class="grid grid-cols-1 items-center gap-kro-xx-large lg:grid-cols-2"><ul data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal m-0 grid grid-cols-1 list-none gap-kro-large p-0"><li class="flex gap-kro-medium"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 inline-flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-kro-field border border-kro-hairline text-kro-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-timer" aria-hidden="true"><line x1="10" x2="14" y1="2" y2="2"></line><line x1="12" x2="15" y1="14" y2="11"></line><circle cx="12" cy="14" r="8"></circle></svg></span><div><h3 class="m-0 font-semibold text-kro-fore text-lg">Countdown or stopwatch</h3><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-kro-fore-secondary">Count down to a goal, or count up when the work decides how long it takes. Breaks are part of the rhythm, not an interruption of it.</p></div></li><li class="flex gap-kro-medium"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 inline-flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-kro-field border border-kro-hairline text-kro-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-layers" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12.83 2.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 6.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.83l8.58 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0l8.58-3.9a1 1 0 0 0 0-1.83z"></path><path d="M2 12a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 12"></path><path d="M2 17a1 1 0 0 0 .58.91l8.6 3.91a2 2 0 0 0 1.65 0l8.58-3.9A1 1 0 0 0 22 17"></path></svg></span><div><h3 class="m-0 font-semibold text-kro-fore text-lg">The Session Pill</h3><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-kro-fore-secondary">While a Session runs, a small pill follows you around the app, so you never lose your place or the time.</p></div></li><li class="flex gap-kro-medium"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 inline-flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-kro-field border border-kro-hairline text-kro-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-smartphone" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M12 18h.01"></path></svg></span><div><h3 class="m-0 font-semibold text-kro-fore text-lg">On the Lock Screen</h3><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-kro-fore-secondary">On iPhone, a Live Activity keeps your running Session on the Lock Screen, with Pause and Finish within reach.</p></div></li><li class="flex gap-kro-medium"><span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-1 inline-flex size-11 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-kro-field border border-kro-hairline text-kro-accent"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-watch" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 10v2.2l1.6 1"></path><path d="m16.13 7.66-.81-4.05a2 2 0 0 0-2-1.61h-2.68a2 2 0 0 0-2 1.61l-.78 4.05"></path><path d="m7.88 16.36.8 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h2.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61l.81-4.05"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle></svg></span><div><h3 class="m-0 font-semibold text-kro-fore text-lg">On your wrist</h3><p class="m-0 mt-1 text-kro-fore-secondary">The wrist is a mirror, not a second opinion.</p></div></li></ul><div data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal grid grid-cols-1 justify-items-center gap-kro-x-large"><div class="flex items-end justify-center gap-kro-large"><div class="w-[min(60vw,260px)]"><div class="kro-device kro-device--phone" style="--kro-device-w: 800px;"><img width="780" height="1342" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Kro's focus session sheet on a phone-sized window: a Pomodoro clock counting down from fifteen minutes for the task Prepare slides, with pause and stop buttons." src="/landing/web/web-session-mobile-dark.webp"></div></div><div class="w-[min(26vw,120px)]"><div class="kro-device kro-device--watch" style="--kro-device-w: 412px;"><img width="396" height="484" decoding="async" loading="lazy" alt="Kro on Apple Watch: a Now Hero card for the high-priority task Prepare presentation at 7:00 PM with a Start Focus 45m button." src="/landing/watchos/watch-featured.webp"></div></div></div><figure class="m-0 w-full max-w-[420px]"><img width="844" height="384" alt="Kro's lock screen Live Activity on iPhone: a purple card reading Focusing, Draft release notes and 15:00, with Pause and Finish buttons." loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="block h-auto w-full rounded-kro-surface border border-kro-hairline shadow-kro-card" src="/landing/ios/ios-live-activity-running.webp"></figure></div></div></div></section><section id="platforms" data-tone="canvas" aria-labelledby="platforms-title" class="kro-marketing-section"><div class="kro-marketing-container kro-marketing-container--wide"><header data-align="start" data-level="2" class="kro-section-header"><p class="kro-eyebrow">Platforms</p><h2 id="platforms-title" class="kro-display-2">Wherever your day is.</h2><p class="kro-lede">Available soon — vote to get it sooner.</p></header><div data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal"><ul class="m-0 mb-kro-xx-large flex list-none flex-wrap gap-kro-small p-0"><li><button type="button" class="kro-platform-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-smartphone" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M12 18h.01"></path></svg><span>iPhone</span><span class="kro-platform-badge__status" data-status="testflight">TestFlight</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="kro-platform-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-tablet" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="16" height="20" x="4" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg><span>iPad</span><span class="kro-platform-badge__status" data-status="testflight">TestFlight</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="kro-platform-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-laptop" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8.526a2 2 0 0 0 .212.897l1.068 2.127a1 1 0 0 1-.9 1.45H3.62a1 1 0 0 1-.9-1.45l1.068-2.127A2 2 0 0 0 4 15.526V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"></path><path d="M20.054 15.987H3.946"></path></svg><span>Mac</span><span class="kro-platform-badge__status" data-status="testflight">TestFlight</span></button></li><li><button type="button" class="kro-platform-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-watch" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 10v2.2l1.6 1"></path><path d="m16.13 7.66-.81-4.05a2 2 0 0 0-2-1.61h-2.68a2 2 0 0 0-2 1.61l-.78 4.05"></path><path d="m7.88 16.36.8 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h2.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61l.81-4.05"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle></svg><span>Apple Watch</span><span class="kro-platform-badge__status" data-status="testflight">TestFlight</span></button></li><li><a href="https://app.kro.example/my-day" class="kro-platform-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg><span>Web</span><span class="kro-platform-badge__status" data-status="live">Live</span></a></li><li><span class="kro-platform-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-smartphone" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M12 18h.01"></path></svg><span>Android</span><span class="kro-platform-badge__status" data-status="in-progress">In progress</span></span></li><li><span class="kro-platform-badge"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-monitor" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="3" rx="2"></rect><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="21" y2="21"></line><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="17" y2="21"></line></svg><span>Windows</span><span class="kro-platform-badge__status" data-status="coming">Coming soon</span></span></li></ul></div><div data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal grid grid-cols-1 gap-kro-large sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-accent);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-smartphone" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M12 18h.01"></path></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">iPhone</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Early access on TestFlight. The full loop, with a Live Activity for your Session.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-accent);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-tablet" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="16" height="20" x="4" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="18" y2="18"></line></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">iPad</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Early access on TestFlight. A sidebar for the whole workflow.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-accent);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-laptop" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 5a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8.526a2 2 0 0 0 .212.897l1.068 2.127a1 1 0 0 1-.9 1.45H3.62a1 1 0 0 1-.9-1.45l1.068-2.127A2 2 0 0 0 4 15.526V7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"></path><path d="M20.054 15.987H3.946"></path></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">Mac</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Early access on TestFlight. The desktop home of your plans.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-accent);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-watch" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 10v2.2l1.6 1"></path><path d="m16.13 7.66-.81-4.05a2 2 0 0 0-2-1.61h-2.68a2 2 0 0 0-2 1.61l-.78 4.05"></path><path d="m7.88 16.36.8 4a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h2.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61l.81-4.05"></path><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="6"></circle></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">Apple Watch</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Early access on TestFlight. What is Now, one glance away.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-focus-green);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-globe" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">Web</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Live today. Installable, and it works from any modern browser.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-accent);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-smartphone" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="14" height="20" x="5" y="2" rx="2" ry="2"></rect><path d="M12 18h.01"></path></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">Android</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">In progress. It is being built now.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-accent);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-monitor" aria-hidden="true"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="3" rx="2"></rect><line x1="8" x2="16" y1="21" y2="21"></line><line x1="12" x2="12" y1="17" y2="21"></line></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">Windows</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Coming. It is on the list, and your vote moves it up.</p></article></div><div data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal mt-kro-xx-large grid gap-kro-medium rounded-kro-surface border border-kro-hairline p-kro-large"><h3 id="platforms-vote-title" class="m-0 font-semibold text-kro-fore text-xl">Tell us which platform to build next.</h3><div role="group" aria-labelledby="platforms-vote-title" class="flex flex-wrap gap-kro-small"><button data-slot="button" data-shape="circular" data-size="lg" type="button" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1 cursor-default whitespace-nowrap font-medium kro-motion-quick transition-[color,background-color,box-shadow,transform] outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-[var(--kro-opacity-disabled)] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none kro-glass kro-glass--control kro-glass--interactive text-kro-fore h-11 rounded-kro-small px-kro-medium text-sm rounded-kro-pill [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4">Vote for Android</button><button data-slot="button" data-shape="circular" data-size="lg" type="button" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1 cursor-default whitespace-nowrap font-medium kro-motion-quick transition-[color,background-color,box-shadow,transform] outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-[var(--kro-opacity-disabled)] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none kro-glass kro-glass--control kro-glass--interactive text-kro-fore h-11 rounded-kro-small px-kro-medium text-sm rounded-kro-pill [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4">Vote for Windows</button></div></div></div></section><section id="federation" data-tone="subtle" aria-labelledby="federation-title" class="kro-marketing-section"><div class="kro-marketing-container kro-marketing-container--wide"><header data-align="start" data-level="2" class="kro-section-header"><p class="kro-eyebrow">Federation</p><h2 id="federation-title" class="kro-display-2">Kro is a federation, not an island</h2><p class="kro-lede">Your plans meet the tools you already use, instead of asking you to leave them.</p></header><div data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal grid grid-cols-1 gap-kro-large sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4"><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-accent);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-cloud" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M17.5 19H9a7 7 0 1 1 6.71-9h1.79a4.5 4.5 0 1 1 0 9Z"></path></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">Kro Cloud</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Sign in to Kro — sync your plans across devices.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-accent);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-days" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M16 2v3"></path><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M3 9h18"></path><path d="M8 13h.01"></path><path d="M12 13h.01"></path><path d="M16 13h.01"></path><path d="M8 17h.01"></path><path d="M12 17h.01"></path><path d="M16 17h.01"></path></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">Apple Calendar</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">See your events alongside your endeavors on the same timeline.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-accent);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-checks" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 5h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 19h8"></path><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><path d="m3 7 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">Apple Reminders</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Bring your reminders into the day without retyping them.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-accent);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-calendar-range" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><path d="M16 2v3"></path><path d="M3 9h18"></path><path d="M8 2v3"></path><path d="M17 13h-6"></path><path d="M13 17H7"></path><path d="M7 13h.01"></path><path d="M17 17h.01"></path></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">Google Calendar</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Connect Google Calendar and plan around what is already booked.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-payne-gray);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-list-todo" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 5h8"></path><path d="M13 12h8"></path><path d="M13 19h8"></path><path d="m3 17 2 2 4-4"></path><rect x="3" y="4" width="6" height="6" rx="1"></rect></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">Google Tasks</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Coming next.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-payne-gray);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-check-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M18 6 7 17l-5-5"></path><path d="m22 10-7.5 7.5L13 16"></path></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">Microsoft To Do</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Coming next.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-payne-gray);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-git-branch" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M15 6a9 9 0 0 0-9 9V3"></path><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3"></circle><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"></circle></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">GitHub</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Coming next.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-payne-gray);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-kanban" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 3v14"></path><path d="M12 3v8"></path><path d="M19 3v18"></path></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">Jira</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Coming next.</p></article></div></div></section><section id="privacy" data-tone="glass" aria-labelledby="privacy-title" class="kro-marketing-section"><div aria-hidden="true" data-testid="detail-backdrop" class="kro-detail-backdrop"></div><div class="kro-marketing-container kro-marketing-container--wide"><div class="kro-glass kro-marketing-section__panel"><div class="text-kro-fore" style="--kro-color-fore-secondary: var(--kro-color-fore-secondary-on-glass);"><header data-align="start" data-level="2" class="kro-section-header"><p class="kro-eyebrow">Privacy</p><h2 id="privacy-title" class="kro-display-2">Your day stays yours</h2><p class="kro-lede">Kro measures how the product is used, never what you write in it.</p></header><div data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal grid grid-cols-1 gap-kro-large md:grid-cols-3"><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-accent);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-shield-check" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z"></path><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"></path></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">Your day stays yours</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Your plans live on your device first. Sign in only if you want them to follow you to another one.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-accent);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-eye-off" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10.733 5.076a10.744 10.744 0 0 1 11.205 6.575 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.747 10.747 0 0 1-1.444 2.49"></path><path d="M14.084 14.158a3 3 0 0 1-4.242-4.242"></path><path d="M17.479 17.499a10.75 10.75 0 0 1-15.417-5.151 1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 4.446-5.143"></path><path d="m2 2 20 20"></path></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">We never send what you write</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Counts, timings, the page you are on and your browser's size and language — never the words you write.</p></article><article class="kro-feature-card" style="--kro-card-accent: var(--kro-color-accent);"><span class="kro-feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-fingerprint-pattern" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 10a2 2 0 0 0-2 2c0 1.02-.1 2.51-.26 4"></path><path d="M14 13.12c0 2.38 0 6.38-1 8.88"></path><path d="M17.29 21.02c.12-.6.43-2.3.5-3.02"></path><path d="M2 12a10 10 0 0 1 18-6"></path><path d="M2 16h.01"></path><path d="M21.8 16c.2-2 .131-5.354 0-6"></path><path d="M5 19.5C5.5 18 6 15 6 12a6 6 0 0 1 .34-2"></path><path d="M8.65 22c.21-.66.45-1.32.57-2"></path><path d="M9 6.8a6 6 0 0 1 9 5.2v2"></path></svg></span><h3 class="kro-feature-card__title">A visit is not a person</h3><p class="kro-feature-card__body">Cookieless analytics: a visit is an anonymous, rotating hash, never a name or an email.</p></article></div></div></div></div></section><section id="early-access" data-tone="canvas" aria-labelledby="early-access-title" class="kro-marketing-section"><div class="kro-marketing-container kro-marketing-container--narrow"><div aria-hidden="true" class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0"><span class="kro-glow-blob" style="top: 10%; left: -20%; opacity: 0.35;"></span><span class="kro-glow-blob kro-glow-blob--grape" style="bottom: -10%; right: -20%; opacity: 0.35;"></span></div><div class="relative"><header data-align="start" data-level="2" class="kro-section-header kro-section-header--on-glow"><p class="kro-eyebrow">Early access</p><h2 id="early-access-title" class="kro-display-2">Be first through the door.</h2><p class="kro-lede">Tell us where you want Kro, and we will write when it is ready for you.</p></header><div data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal"><div class="kro-glass p-6 text-kro-fore md:p-10" data-state="idle"><form novalidate="" aria-busy="false" class="grid gap-kro-large"><div role="group" data-slot="field" data-density="compact" data-orientation="vertical" data-validation="none" aria-labelledby="_r_25_-label" class="w-full text-kro-fore flex flex-col gap-kro-small"><span id="_r_25_-label" class="shrink-0"><label data-slot="label" data-density="compact" for="_r_24_-email" class="text-kro-fore font-medium text-[13px]">Email address<span aria-hidden="true">*</span><span class="sr-only"> required</span></label></span><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col gap-kro-tiny"><input data-slot="input" data-density="comfortable" class="flex w-full min-w-0 rounded-kro-field px-kro-small h-9 text-sm bg-kro-back-inner text-kro-fore border border-kro-hairline placeholder:text-kro-fore-secondary kro-motion-quick transition-[border-color,box-shadow] outline-none disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-[var(--kro-opacity-disabled)] aria-invalid:border-kro-banner-danger file:inline-flex file:border-0 file:bg-transparent file:text-xs file:font-medium min-h-11" id="_r_24_-email" inputmode="email" autocomplete="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required="" aria-required="true" aria-describedby="_r_24_-notice" type="email" value="" name="email"><p id="_r_24_-notice" class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary text-xs">We keep your address and platform pick only to tell you when early access opens, then delete them. The sign-up also records which part of the page you used, your browser's language and the time. To be removed sooner, write to us through the link in the footer.</p></div></div><fieldset class="m-0 grid min-w-0 gap-kro-small border-0 p-0"><legend class="px-0 pb-kro-small font-medium text-kro-fore text-sm">Which platform should we write about?</legend><div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-kro-small sm:grid-cols-4"><label class="relative flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer"><input class="peer absolute inset-0 m-0 size-full cursor-pointer opacity-0" type="radio" value="ios" checked="" name="early-access-platform"><span class="flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-kro-pill border border-kro-hairline px-kro-small text-kro-fore text-sm peer-checked:border-transparent peer-checked:bg-kro-accent peer-checked:font-semibold peer-checked:text-kro-on-accent peer-focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]">iPhone</span></label><label class="relative flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer"><input class="peer absolute inset-0 m-0 size-full cursor-pointer opacity-0" type="radio" value="ipados" name="early-access-platform"><span class="flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-kro-pill border border-kro-hairline px-kro-small text-kro-fore text-sm peer-checked:border-transparent peer-checked:bg-kro-accent peer-checked:font-semibold peer-checked:text-kro-on-accent peer-focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]">iPad</span></label><label class="relative flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer"><input class="peer absolute inset-0 m-0 size-full cursor-pointer opacity-0" type="radio" value="macos" name="early-access-platform"><span class="flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-kro-pill border border-kro-hairline px-kro-small text-kro-fore text-sm peer-checked:border-transparent peer-checked:bg-kro-accent peer-checked:font-semibold peer-checked:text-kro-on-accent peer-focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]">Mac</span></label><label class="relative flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer"><input class="peer absolute inset-0 m-0 size-full cursor-pointer opacity-0" type="radio" value="watchos" name="early-access-platform"><span class="flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-kro-pill border border-kro-hairline px-kro-small text-kro-fore text-sm peer-checked:border-transparent peer-checked:bg-kro-accent peer-checked:font-semibold peer-checked:text-kro-on-accent peer-focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]">Apple Watch</span></label><label class="relative flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer"><input class="peer absolute inset-0 m-0 size-full cursor-pointer opacity-0" type="radio" value="web" name="early-access-platform"><span class="flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-kro-pill border border-kro-hairline px-kro-small text-kro-fore text-sm peer-checked:border-transparent peer-checked:bg-kro-accent peer-checked:font-semibold peer-checked:text-kro-on-accent peer-focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]">Web</span></label><label class="relative flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer"><input class="peer absolute inset-0 m-0 size-full cursor-pointer opacity-0" type="radio" value="android" name="early-access-platform"><span class="flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-kro-pill border border-kro-hairline px-kro-small text-kro-fore text-sm peer-checked:border-transparent peer-checked:bg-kro-accent peer-checked:font-semibold peer-checked:text-kro-on-accent peer-focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]">Android</span></label><label class="relative flex min-h-11 cursor-pointer"><input class="peer absolute inset-0 m-0 size-full cursor-pointer opacity-0" type="radio" value="windows" name="early-access-platform"><span class="flex w-full items-center justify-center rounded-kro-pill border border-kro-hairline px-kro-small text-kro-fore text-sm peer-checked:border-transparent peer-checked:bg-kro-accent peer-checked:font-semibold peer-checked:text-kro-on-accent peer-focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]">Windows</span></label></div></fieldset><div aria-hidden="true" style="position: absolute; left: -10000px; width: 1px; height: 1px; overflow: hidden;"><label for="_r_24_-website">Website</label><input id="_r_24_-website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" type="text" value="" name="website"></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-kro-medium"><button data-slot="button" data-shape="circular" data-size="lg" type="submit" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1 cursor-default whitespace-nowrap font-medium kro-motion-quick transition-[color,background-color,box-shadow,transform] outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-[var(--kro-opacity-disabled)] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none kro-glass kro-glass--control kro-glass--accent kro-glass--interactive text-kro-on-accent h-11 rounded-kro-small px-kro-medium text-sm rounded-kro-pill [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4">Get early access</button><p class="m-0 max-w-[40ch] text-sm" style="color: var(--kro-color-fore-secondary-on-glass);">We don't show sign-up counts, ratings or quotes here. We'll email you when your platform is ready.</p></div></form></div></div></div></div></section><section id="faq" data-tone="subtle" aria-labelledby="faq-title" class="kro-marketing-section"><div class="kro-marketing-container kro-marketing-container--narrow"><header data-align="start" data-level="2" class="kro-section-header"><p class="kro-eyebrow">Questions</p><h2 id="faq-title" class="kro-display-2">Good questions, plainly answered.</h2></header><div data-reveal="idle" class="kro-reveal"><div data-slot="accordion" data-size="large" data-density="comfortable" class="flex w-full flex-col [&amp;_button]:min-h-11"><div data-slot="accordion-item"><button type="button" id="_r_26_-endeavor-header" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_26_-endeavor-panel" class="flex w-full items-center gap-kro-small px-kro-medium min-h-9 text-sm text-left text-kro-fore outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right kro-motion-quick shrink-0 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium">What is an endeavor?</span></button><div id="_r_26_-endeavor-panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="_r_26_-endeavor-header" hidden="" data-slot="accordion-panel" class="px-kro-medium pb-kro-small text-kro-fore"><p class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary">An endeavor is anything you have decided is worth your time — a task, an event or a habit. Capture creates it, and it travels through the loop until it is done.</p></div></div><div data-slot="accordion-item"><div aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-divider" class="h-px bg-kro-hairline"></div><button type="button" id="_r_26_-free-header" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_26_-free-panel" class="flex w-full items-center gap-kro-small px-kro-medium min-h-9 text-sm text-left text-kro-fore outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right kro-motion-quick shrink-0 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium">Is Kro free?</span></button><div id="_r_26_-free-panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="_r_26_-free-header" hidden="" data-slot="accordion-panel" class="px-kro-medium pb-kro-small text-kro-fore"><p class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary">Kro for Web is open to use today, and you can start without an account. We have not announced pricing for the other platforms, and we would rather say so than guess.</p></div></div><div data-slot="accordion-item"><div aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-divider" class="h-px bg-kro-hairline"></div><button type="button" id="_r_26_-data-header" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_26_-data-panel" class="flex w-full items-center gap-kro-small px-kro-medium min-h-9 text-sm text-left text-kro-fore outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right kro-motion-quick shrink-0 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium">Where is my data stored?</span></button><div id="_r_26_-data-panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="_r_26_-data-header" hidden="" data-slot="accordion-panel" class="px-kro-medium pb-kro-small text-kro-fore"><p class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary">On your device first. If you sign in, your plans sync through Kro Cloud. Analytics counts, timings, the page you are on and your browser's size and language — never the words you write.</p></div></div><div data-slot="accordion-item"><div aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-divider" class="h-px bg-kro-hairline"></div><button type="button" id="_r_26_-offline-header" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_26_-offline-panel" class="flex w-full items-center gap-kro-small px-kro-medium min-h-9 text-sm text-left text-kro-fore outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right kro-motion-quick shrink-0 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium">Does it work offline?</span></button><div id="_r_26_-offline-panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="_r_26_-offline-header" hidden="" data-slot="accordion-panel" class="px-kro-medium pb-kro-small text-kro-fore"><p class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary">Kro for Web installs as an app and its shell opens without a connection, with your plans kept on your device. Syncing through Kro Cloud needs a connection.</p></div></div><div data-slot="accordion-item"><div aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-divider" class="h-px bg-kro-hairline"></div><button type="button" id="_r_26_-platforms-header" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_26_-platforms-panel" class="flex w-full items-center gap-kro-small px-kro-medium min-h-9 text-sm text-left text-kro-fore outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right kro-motion-quick shrink-0 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium">Which platforms?</span></button><div id="_r_26_-platforms-panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="_r_26_-platforms-header" hidden="" data-slot="accordion-panel" class="px-kro-medium pb-kro-small text-kro-fore"><p class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary">The web is live. iPhone, iPad, Mac and Apple Watch are in early access on TestFlight, Android is in progress and Windows is coming. Vote for the one you want sooner.</p></div></div><div data-slot="accordion-item"><div aria-hidden="true" data-slot="accordion-divider" class="h-px bg-kro-hairline"></div><button type="button" id="_r_26_-todo-header" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="_r_26_-todo-panel" class="flex w-full items-center gap-kro-small px-kro-medium min-h-9 text-sm text-left text-kro-fore outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)]"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-right kro-motion-quick shrink-0 transition-transform" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m9 18 6-6-6-6"></path></svg><span class="min-w-0 flex-1 font-medium">How is this different from a to-do list?</span></button><div id="_r_26_-todo-panel" role="region" aria-labelledby="_r_26_-todo-header" hidden="" data-slot="accordion-panel" class="px-kro-medium pb-kro-small text-kro-fore"><p class="m-0 text-kro-fore-secondary">A to-do list stores tasks. Kro runs the whole loop: Capture, Triage with Value and Effort, Plan, Do with focus Sessions, and Earn what you have worked for.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><div id="start" data-tone="canvas" class="kro-marketing-section"><div class="kro-marketing-container kro-marketing-container--wide"><div class="kro-glass-cta"><span aria-hidden="true" class="kro-glow-blob" style="top: -20%; left: 8%;"></span><span aria-hidden="true" class="kro-glow-blob kro-glow-blob--grape" style="bottom: -24%; right: 6%;"></span><div class="kro-glass kro-glass-cta__card" style="border-radius: var(--kro-glass-cta-radius);"><p class="kro-eyebrow">Manage your time, like the gods</p><h2 class="kro-display-2">Start your first resolved day.</h2><p class="kro-lede">Plan, Do and Earn, in one personal execution system.</p><div class="kro-glass-cta__actions"><a href="https://app.kro.example/my-day" data-slot="button" data-shape="circular" data-size="lg" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1 cursor-default whitespace-nowrap font-medium kro-motion-quick transition-[color,background-color,box-shadow,transform] outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-[var(--kro-opacity-disabled)] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none kro-glass kro-glass--control kro-glass--accent kro-glass--interactive text-kro-on-accent h-11 rounded-kro-small px-kro-medium text-sm rounded-kro-pill [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4">Open Kro for Web</a><a href="#early-access" data-slot="button" data-shape="circular" data-size="lg" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center justify-center gap-1 cursor-default whitespace-nowrap font-medium kro-motion-quick transition-[color,background-color,box-shadow,transform] outline-none focus-visible:shadow-[var(--kro-ring)] active:scale-[0.97] disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-[var(--kro-opacity-disabled)] [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none kro-glass kro-glass--control kro-glass--interactive text-kro-fore h-11 rounded-kro-small px-kro-medium text-sm rounded-kro-pill [&amp;_svg:not([class*='size-'])]:size-4">Get early access</a></div></div></div></div></div></main><div><footer class="kro-marketing-footer"><div class="kro-marketing-container"><div class="kro-marketing-footer__grid"><div><div class="kro-marketing-nav__brand"><span>Kro</span></div><p class="kro-marketing-footer__tagline">Plan · Do · Earn</p></div><nav aria-label="Footer" class="kro-marketing-footer__columns"><div><h2 class="kro-marketing-footer__title">Product</h2><ul class="kro-marketing-footer__list"><li><a class="kro-marketing-footer__link" href="#the-loop">The loop</a></li><li><a class="kro-marketing-footer__link" href="#focus">Sessions</a></li><li><a class="kro-marketing-footer__link" href="#platforms">Platforms</a></li><li><a class="kro-marketing-footer__link" href="#early-access">Early access</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class="kro-marketing-footer__title">Open source</h2><ul class="kro-marketing-footer__list"><li><a class="kro-marketing-footer__link" href="https://github.com/zheref/kro-pwa" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Kro for Web on GitHub<span class="sr-only"> (opens in a new tab)</span></a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class="kro-marketing-footer__title">Trust</h2><ul class="kro-marketing-footer__list"><li><a class="kro-marketi